{"b":"Job","c":36,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Elihu also proceeded, and said,"},{"n":2,"t":"Suffer me a little, and I will shew thee that I have yet to speak on God’s behalf.","it":[[46,52]],"x":[["Job.13.7",3,"r"],["Job.13.8",3,"r"],["2Cor.5.20",3,"r"],["Job.21.3",3,"w"],["Heb.13.22",2,"w"],["Ezek.2.7",2,"r"],["Job.33.6",2,"r"],["Jer.15.19",2,"r"],["Job.33.31",2,"r"],["Job.33.33",2,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"I will fetch my knowledge from afar, and will ascribe righteousness to my Maker.","x":[["Jas.3.17",5,"r"],["Jas.1.17",4,"r"],["Job.8.3",3,"r"],["Ps.145.17",3,"r"],["Dan.9.14",3,"r"],["Ps.11.7",3,"w"],["Deut.32.4",3,"r"],["Dan.9.7",3,"w"],["Rev.15.3",3,"r"],["Job.32.8",3,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"For truly my words shall not be false: he that is perfect in knowledge is with thee.","it":[[19,24],[29,31],[71,73]],"x":[["Job.37.16",4,"w"],["2Tim.3.16",3,"r"],["2Tim.3.17",3,"w"],["Prov.8.7",3,"r"],["Prov.8.8",3,"r"],["1Cor.14.20",3,"r"],["2Cor.2.17",2,"r"],["Job.21.34",2,"r"],["Luke.1.3",2,"w"],["Col.4.12",2,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Behold, God is mighty, and despiseth not any: he is mighty in strength and wisdom.","it":[[12,14],[41,51],[71,74]],"x":[["Ps.22.24",7,"r"],["Jer.10.12",5,"w"],["Ps.138.6",5,"r"],["Ps.147.5",4,"r"],["Jer.32.19",4,"w"],["Job.37.23",4,"r"],["Job.31.13",3,"r"],["Job.12.13",3,"w"],["Job.12.16",3,"w"],["Job.26.12",3,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"He preserveth not the life of the wicked: but giveth right to the poor.","x":[["Ps.72.12",6,"w"],["Ps.72.14",6,"r"],["Job.21.7",5,"w"],["Job.21.9",5,"r"],["Ps.140.12",5,"w"],["Job.5.15",5,"w"],["Exod.22.22",5,"r"],["Exod.22.24",5,"r"],["Ps.9.12",4,"r"],["2Pet.2.9",4,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"He withdraweth not his eyes from the righteous: but with kings are they on the throne; yea, he doth establish them for ever, and they are exalted.","it":[[63,71]],"x":[["Ps.34.15",16,"w"],["Ps.33.18",15,"r"],["1Sam.2.8",14,"w"],["Ps.113.7",13,"r"],["Ps.113.8",13,"r"],["2Thess.3.3",11,"r"],["1Pet.3.12",10,"w"],["Job.42.12",10,"r"],["Esth.10.3",10,"r"],["Job.1.3",9,